    "detailed_description": "<h1>PUBLISH YOUR GAMES WITH US!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/087a625b734d3385cefd1f6e43daa848.avif?t=1755610976\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/9a372115fc0f7302f1c064208a05d596.avif?t=1755610976\" width=616 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf8 Play as a toy-sized soldier</h2>Experience the world from a miniature perspective, where everyday objects become massive obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/a1c93a69ea96ce2e20433d98855d0cda.poster.avif?t=1755610976\" width=800 height=508 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/a1c93a69ea96ce2e20433d98855d0cda.webm?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/a1c93a69ea96ce2e20433d98855d0cda.mp4?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc66 Up to 4-player co-op</h2>Team up with friends to climb, jump, and help each other escape \u2014 or watch them fall and laugh a little.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/f332e75cff80e9aed14e54fc426fcbc9.poster.avif?t=1755610976\" width=800 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/f332e75cff80e9aed14e54fc426fcbc9.webm?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/f332e75cff80e9aed14e54fc426fcbc9.mp4?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd7 Climb your way to freedom</h2>Navigate through furniture, tools, shelves, and more to reach the rooftop and escape the house.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/41990cc5474b5ec252746f996c51a239.poster.avif?t=1755610976\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/41990cc5474b5ec252746f996c51a239.webm?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/41990cc5474b5ec252746f996c51a239.mp4?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08 Colorful and stylized visuals</h2>Bright, polished graphics bring the toy world to life in a vibrant, fun aesthetic.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/b86f3dae74f81a27471d3219364034eb.poster.avif?t=1755610976\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/b86f3dae74f81a27471d3219364034eb.webm?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/b86f3dae74f81a27471d3219364034eb.mp4?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
