each the rooftop and escape the house.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/41990cc5474b5ec252746f996c51a239.poster.avif?t=1755610976\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/41990cc5474b5ec252746f996c51a239.webm?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/41990cc5474b5ec252746f996c51a239.mp4?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08 Colorful and stylized visuals</h2>Bright, polished graphics bring the toy world to life in a vibrant, fun aesthetic.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/b86f3dae74f81a27471d3219364034eb.poster.avif?t=1755610976\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/b86f3dae74f81a27471d3219364034eb.webm?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654580/extras/b86f3dae74f81a27471d3219364034eb.mp4?t=1755610976\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
